      "id": "r16-second-largest-country",
      "text": {
        "en": "Only one country on earth is bigger than Canada. Canada covers about 10 million square kilometres.",
        "fr": "Un seul pays au monde est plus grand que le Canada. Le Canada couvre environ 10 millions de kilomètres carrés."
